{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":50592,\"title\":\"Shipping Wars\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Shipping Wars is a reality TV series on A&E that began airing on January 10, 2012. The show follows six independent carriers who have discovered that fortunes can be made transporting items that traditional carriers either cannot or will not haul. The series also features uShip, the world’s largest online auction house for independent truckers. For Season 1, the featured carriers are Marc Springer, Roy Garber, Jennifer Brennan, Jarrett Joyce, and Suzanne and Scott Bawcom. Starting with Season 2, the Bawcoms are replaced by the team of Christopher Hanna and Robbie Welsh. Season 3 premiered on December 12, 2012 . New shippers Johnny Chavez and the team of Chelsea Grant and Courtney Aguilera appear in Season 4.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AcZTjWs5ajlLaHjsahSKP6R3JdP.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7orgojRRZCp9q8ufQ0zLl1CpLt1.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":21,\"year\":2012,\"genres\":[\"Reality\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":9,\"totalEpisodes\":116,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"A&E\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2022-01-25\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4458119,\"name\":\"Dwight Fountain\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458120,\"name\":\"Tyesha Fountain\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458121,\"name\":\"Natasha Schneider\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458122,\"name\":\"Doug Smith\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458123,\"name\":\"Molly Rivero\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458124,\"name\":\"Russell Rivero\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4458125,\"name\":\"Tamara Brock\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"lfYBQGF4v0s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KgUgplq60xA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Dfcd5AKQpVk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":291930,\"title\":\"Road Trip\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jzI65R8EZwBbRw723iE79Ho5T8Z.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4166666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94879,\"title\":\"Road Quest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2s9luYgQm1aAtIUS2cnkQ3GJTwf.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41250000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":291699,\"title\":\"On the Trail of Easy Rider: 40 Years On... Still Searching for America\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/49u6fzOZqLEcEpDkhi1XQT47LeR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40914634146341466,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":134628,\"title\":\"The Hairy Bikers Go North\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSu8QF1KLZACTQKATLPCnMSzeLz.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40681818181818186,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":65191,\"title\":\"Drake's Passage\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21846153846153848,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":321691,\"title\":\"The Great American Road Rally: Celebrity Edition\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2170212765957447,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":316517,\"title\":\"Potje Rijden: Kirgizië\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gsVvB7Xd240FEHvQVMAhffECRj.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21682242990654207,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":30975,\"title\":\"Tattoo Highway\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oqbm5qcp2A0gQc8ZwNwtCIPeVXM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21263157894736842,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217568,\"title\":\"Bros On Foot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/98ktxSmEUWjQKEdIV5hdDEjrkqf.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2111111111111111,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":315551,\"title\":\"Roadtrip Australia – Three Top Chefs on Four Wheels\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPoNNDKhvcoWVEyk3stx6TzV09x.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20967741935483872,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":70662,\"title\":\"Road 66\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20849056603773586,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":65032,\"title\":\"Jon Richardson Grows Up\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8lKim1fY2IRQM0ILpMyyE8GSMLK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20689655172413796,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":7,\"seasonName\":\"Season 7\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AcZTjWs5ajlLaHjsahSKP6R3JdP.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2014-11-18\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Goose Bumps in the Road\",\"overview\":\"Samko reluctantly teams up with Jenn after Jenn bids way above her weight class. When Jenn isn't completely forthright, Samko threatens to bring this load toppling down. Dusty takes on a pricey flock of geese decoys and struggles to keep them in prime hunting shape.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v6o7N14YYCXBXpTw96oNb340cZA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-18\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Silver Whining Playbook\",\"overview\":\"Dusty's sensitive side is called on when he nets the job of transporting hundreds of live butterflies. Meanwhile, Jarrett confirms he does not have the \\\"Midas touch\\\" -- as his quarter of a million-dollar bullion run turns into a fiasco.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5TGC258Lxj0mQrsjlXNMJGCY7fq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-18\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Smooth Sailin', Rough Ridin'\",\"overview\":\"Marc is at the helm of relaunching a massive homemade houseboat but the family's history with the boat, and Marc's stormy attitude, threaten to sink the job before it ever reaches water. Meanwhile, Jarrett meets his match when a bizarre load comes with an even crazier traveling companion.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/umFjBMY0UP95XKpTuAGkqP0UEwM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-25\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Mini Golf & Massive Headaches\",\"overview\":\"After winning a black light putt-putt golf course, Jenn's game is tested when she realizes that for her run, \\\"MINI-golf\\\" is a misnomer. Todd and Tamera are literally in over their heads when rappelling skills are required at their modern art pickup.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lN00XJ6RMX1zYobWE3tt0GWZwz1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-25\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Power Rangers & Vampire Dangers\",\"overview\":\"Jenn won't save the world, but she better make her deadline when she hauls a 16-foot-tall Power Ranger to a child's birthday party. Meanwhile, Todd and Tamera make a draining run to the Big Easy with Vampire items.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7GJb8WQhTu1LGI28c1BxdxTuL2T.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-02\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Big Pigs Fly, Little Pirates Cry\",\"overview\":\"Jarrett learns the answer to the question, \\\"Where does the world's largest hog sit?\\\" (anywhere it wants), while hauling a shipment of epic proportions. Samko finds herself in a stand off with a father during the move of a kid's handcrafted, pirate-themed playground.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qaIEpPeT8fKPnFLphFyuCT1NvkQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-02\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Up in Smoke & Going Broke\",\"overview\":\"While shipping an 11-foot-tall glass water pipe to the Mile-High City, Marc tries to mellow out after a blown tire threatens to turn this shipment into shards. Samko saddles up to move an entire barn but when the job gets rough, she does everything she can to keep this show pony from turning into horse feathers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tsQsfyX54ImqQKE85vxPVOO8ePL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-09\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"It's a Rock-A-Fire Implosion!\",\"overview\":\"When tasked with hauling the old animatronic band, Rock-A-Fire Explosion, Jenn ends up pulling a Yoko Ono and almost cancels their reunion tour. Meanwhile, newcomer Chris Kikelhan sends everyone running for cover during his inaugural haul of tornado storm shelters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Xbjw1dHvcBIurVt6j7ZRVscJpv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-09\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Fire and Rescue\",\"overview\":\"After the delivery of sad family news, Jenn turns to Jarrett to take over an odd shipment; while Dusty uses his typical \\\"charm\\\" to dampen the spirits of a family moving a pair of antique fire engines.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a5LAz0uocjVM9JEP6bmUsRiMRxJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Can't See the Sherwood Forrest for the Trees\",\"overview\":\"Todd and Tamera struggle to fly straight after they discover their giant Robin Hood statue load is broken, and Samko is bent to her limits when her massive load of trees is doubled at the pickup.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gha9cVsCyCQnRTBkuwQuzegZkSb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Crying For Your Art\",\"overview\":\"Jarrett literally drops a one-of-a-kind art piece while trying to take matters into his own hands. Marc shows his \\\"shipping thumb\\\" when he raises and hauls a massive Sculpture Garden.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/36ItuIuiBQvsJb5OctgN4SrOnyg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-17\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Looney Tunes Blues\",\"overview\":\"With a pricey load of Looney Tunes memorabilia, Jenn has dreamy thoughts about the single, wealthy client, but reality crashes in when she tangles with a NYC Transit bus; meanwhile Dusty's breaking all sorts of records, along with his back, when he hauls over four tons of vinyl albums.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/677usqQSXg8Qlx3SkgqeKnFFHPm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-17\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Big Bertha & The Molar Express\",\"overview\":\"Jenn gives the University of Texas Marching band's massive drum, Big Bertha a beating, while Todd and Tamera face a train wreck of dental proportions when they tackle a massive train replica headed to a dental office.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9iBrvFaEdZsG90nRWoqJX8Yhys6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-24\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Broken Dolls & Duck Boat Stalls\",\"overview\":\"In true Jarrett form, he makes his run with fragile, antique Christmas dolls even weirder when he tries to check into a hotel to protect them from the cold; but can a WWII era amphibious \\\"Duck Boat\\\" that survived the Germans, make it through a run with Chris Kikelhan?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lchdUMhKnfs46lNaykEaNm8Mloi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-03\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-01-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}